195
00:12:50.083 --> 00:12:52.124
Okay. everybody. look at me.

196
00:12:52.125 --> 00:12:54.957
We are safe. We are in our home.

197
00:12:54.958 --> 00:12:58.750
We have everything we need here.
but most importantly. we have each other.

198
00:12:59.333 --> 00:13:02.333
-Can I have a donut?
-No. Eat your spaghetti.

199
00:13:02.833 --> 00:13:04.125
But I wanna stress eat.

200
00:13:04.792 --> 00:13:06.667
How do you know about stress eating. Ruth?

201
00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:08.458
Graham.

202
00:13:14.583 --> 00:13:17.917
If you can make it in there.
I can make it out here.

203
00:13:18.958 --> 00:13:21.707
Do you think
the running woman has found help?

204
00:13:21.708 --> 00:13:24.249
Someone's gonna come. I promise.

205
00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:26.083
I think it was the rain.

206
00:13:26.583 --> 00:13:28.208
The rain did this.

207
00:13:28.708 --> 00:13:31.667
No. baby. it's just rain.

208
00:13:33.375 --> 00:13:35.707
We'll be fine. I promise.

209
00:13:35.708 --> 00:13:38.667
The rain looked different today.

210
00:13:39.833 --> 00:13:42.125
I'm trying to keep it together
for the kids.

211
00:13:42.625 --> 00:13:46.082
But what the hell's going on. Jason?
How is this real? Like. honestly. how?

212
00:13:46.083 --> 00:13:48.666
-I don't know.
-Oh my God. My parents.

213
00:13:48.667 --> 00:13:50.666
